-- docs/database.md; decisions #36-#42). The tables, the salary_changes.ai_draft_id column and S3
-- are generated by drizzle-kit from src/db/schema/ai.ts; everything after the hand-written marker
-- below is SQL Drizzle cannot express: the reader role, its column grants, ai_scope and the
-- row-level security policies.
